//! entry is owed a decision: revive it as a named step (port it to Zig 0.16
//! and to the geode_test_bin / named-module pattern; a failure that is a
//! product bug stays out of the aggregate, listed in docs/KNOWN_TEST_ISSUES.md),
//! or `git rm` it once a live step covers what it claims. Its CANARY markers
